name: Local package licenses survive repetitions, review, source change and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {}
require-live-snap: 35 license-scan: 0 findings | matching-packages
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART matching
ask: Does the real scanner accept both locally matching package headers without borrowing a sibling declaration or claiming broader legal compliance?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART mismatch
submit: run sast:scan {"taskMode":"manual","tasks":["license-scan"],"triage":false,"verify":false,"autoPatch":false}
require-live-snap: 25 PREREQUISITE PLAN | deterministic-prerequisite
expect: no model cost expected
keys: a
require-live-snap: 35 1 finding(s) | local-mismatch
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART first
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART second
require-live-snap: 35 run receipt | second-pass
submit: run license-scan:scan {}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART third
require-live-snap: 35 run receipt | third-pass
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Source SPDX license header does not match package | local-finding
expect: service/example.rs
expect: signal-only
ask: Do three explicit native passes consolidate into one local service finding while preserving separate observations and signal-only evidence?
submit: decision deferred Owned package metadata needs owner review
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | deferred-review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART deferred
resize: 160x48
live-snap: review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: review-60x20
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 F-0001 · FINDING | evidence-reader
resize: 40x12
live-snap: evidence-40x12
expect: F-0001
expect: PgUp/PgDn read
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: paged-evidence-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: evidence-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: evidence-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: evidence-page-7-40x12
ask: Across six sizes, can the operator read the finding identity, local declaration evidence and retained deferral through normal navigation without accidental actions?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART match
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {}
require-live-snap: 35 license-scan: 0 findings | matching-rerun
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART clean
paste-file: @ART/compare.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 not observed | changed-source-comparison
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 content: | compared-content
expect-not: content:unknown
ask: Does the later matching scan disclose covered absence and changed content while preserving the earlier decision instead of declaring the finding fixed?
keys: Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | retained-review
expect: not observed
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | report
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json | json-report
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | report-exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | recovered-review
expect: not observed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_boundaries.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain five real local scan results, three observations, one scripted decision and the exported absence limitation without paid calls or source execution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
